# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PRISMA
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Keep migrations — DO NOT ignore them
# prisma/migrations/    ← keep this committed!
**/prisma/*.db
**/prisma/*.db-journal
generated/

# Prisma generated client (regenerated on install)
node_modules/.prisma/
node_modules/@prisma/client/

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
